{"name": "Gem Beasts", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Organize and build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gem beasts is a creature collector with roguelike elements, where players make their build using a limited amount of inventory space. Gather items, gems and abilities during your run, and optimize their arrangement to best benefit your build.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/aa4427fad7f7a999ae3d8871e66e32aa.poster.avif?t=1787658953\" width=\"996\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/aa4427fad7f7a999ae3d8871e66e32aa.webm?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/aa4427fad7f7a999ae3d8871e66e32aa.mp4?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find the best combinations!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main appeal of the game is to experiment with different combinations of items, abilities and gems. Learn how to best utilize each Gem Beast and find the most optimal way to consistently break the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/fddc26356b6dfb9483ce11418086893c.poster.avif?t=1787658953\" width=\"996\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/fddc26356b6dfb9483ce11418086893c.webm?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/fddc26356b6dfb9483ce11418086893c.mp4?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlocking new creatures\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a Gem Beast from your collection and go on expeditions across different areas. Defeat the boss of an area, and unlock them as a playable Gem Beast. There are 23 creatures to play as, each with their own unique ability and stats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/204cb70f085e36a0ccf3c967bde3f120.poster.avif?t=1787658953\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/204cb70f085e36a0ccf3c967bde3f120.webm?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/204cb70f085e36a0ccf3c967bde3f120.mp4?t=1787658953\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect and evolve!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress in the game you\u2019ll be able to evolve 17 of the Gem Beasts, which will increase their base stats.\u00a0 By gathering more creatures you\u2019ll also unlock more areas to explore, with stronger creatures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/42f46cc100bbbd109b3900976ccfff3e.apng?t=1787658953\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/42f46cc100bbbd109b3900976ccfff3e.poster.avif?t=1787658953\" width=\"94\"/></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/02d526980e38a5aaa430dc6fc63eaef9.apng?t=1787658953\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/extras/02d526980e38a5aaa430dc6fc63eaef9.poster.avif?t=1787658953\" width=\"178\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">___</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Trailer credits: </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Trailer music by Alfred Storm</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>SFX from Zapsplat and AudioPapkin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional credits can be found in game.\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Gem beasts is a creature collector, roguelike. Fight and collect other creatures to play as, manage your inventory and explore different build combinations.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969740/22bfbbf1b34155a8933654de7913611f82079698/header.jpg?t=1787658953", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Creature Collector", "Action Roguelike", "Inventory Management", "Bullet Hell", "Roguelite", "Cute"], "developers": "Fablesprite Games", "publishers": "Fablesprite Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3969740", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BgLLohbjTno", "first_seen": 1787608800.0, "review_rank": 42}